    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9fb4ee0bfa13b8a35ade56fa",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "『她是作为经典级后冠赛马娘，\n继贵妇人之后史上第2位，\n被选为年度代表赛马娘！』\n",
      "source_fingerprint": "f49253772f8ff0c9931df43b3712bcafaa2631675f842d2571aeef9ddf012e44",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
