    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:33f88a78afc8211df92b6ea6",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "能为声援自己的人而努力――\n北部玄驹的那种强大\n果然也不是杏目的强大。",
      "source_fingerprint": "053b0b8291fc874170730c4eacd1a62df7b382302fee513bdc0f19e1bc9c077b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
